  "instruction": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "text": "Think about what actually happens in the class you are answering about. For each statement, choose how often it happens: Almost Never (1), Seldom (2), Sometimes (3), Often (4), or Almost Always (5). These eight statements are one part of WIHIC. This instruction and separate digital presentation are project adaptations; the statements and frequency labels come from Appendix A (Fraser, 2023). There are no right or wrong answers. Answer from your own experience.",
    "language": "en",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "source": "Project-written digital actual-class instruction using Fraser 2023 Appendix A response anchors; not an author-issued full administration script."
  },
